    "eec8fe60-9979-4b0e-91a8-4a70ed33f813": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "template--14460784935011__eec8fe60-9979-4b0e-91a8-4a70ed33f813-168617389312bc89f2-0": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Introducing the cooler you'll actually want to take with you.",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "template--14460784935011__eec8fe60-9979-4b0e-91a8-4a70ed33f813-168617389312bc89f2-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Coolers can be a pain. They are expensive, heavy, and a chore to lug around. How often have you left your cooler at home because you didn't want to \"deal with it\"? </p><p>Coolers don't have to be a compromise. Getting outdoors and spending time with friends should be carefree, and your gear should make your stress melt away, not add to it. </p><p>Stop lugging 30 lbs of plastic every time you need cold drinks. Be the hero of the picnic, dinner with friends, playground dates, fishing trips, and hikes. Quick walk to the store or out for hours: you can enjoy your drinks cold as hell no matter where you're going, or how long. </p>"
          }
        },
        "template--14460784935011__eec8fe60-9979-4b0e-91a8-4a70ed33f813-168617389312bc89f2-2": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
